  "name": "Forestall Style",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>This skill only produces an effect when you have nothing equipped to your [Hand Slots]. You gain a +4 bonus to [Initiative].</p>\n<p>(SR2): You gain a +2 bonus to [Accuracy].<br>(SR3): You gain a +4 bonus to [Magic Power].</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A fighting style in which both hands are used to make a mark to stabilize the magic power, and the magic is used quickly and accurately.</p>",
